{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_14211590","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14211590","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:7:1421159001:0":{"text":"第一部、深淵の底にあってなお屈せず、天へと放たれた一矢。それは、少年インドラの物語。","source_cn":"第一段，在那深渊之底亦未曾屈服，扬起的利箭！属于少年因...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BC912EC96F6D031","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1421159001":{"text":"第一部、深淵の底にあってなお屈せず、天へと放たれた一矢。それは、少年インドラの物語。","source_cn":"第一段，在那深渊之底亦未曾屈服，扬起的利箭！属于少年因度厄的时光。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BC912EC96F6D031","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1421159002:0":{"text":"あ！おいらが話した内容だ！子どもの時、インドラがキノコ採りの最中に獣を倒したやつ！","source_cn":"啊，是我提供的素材！因度厄小时候采蘑菇途中击败野兽的故事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x193E0EA42B6656E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1421159003:0":{"text":"倒してはいない！私はただ逃げながら相手を撒いて……まあいい。","source_cn":"……没击败！我是先逃跑然后迂回……算了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD44EB0DA3EA367E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1421159004:0":{"text":"仲間の期待と弓矢をその背に、少年はサロクディアの高く聳える城壁の中へと足を踏み入れた。","source_cn":"背负着伙伴们的期待，少年背起弓箭，踏入了萨洛克兰森严的围墙。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD8BCAF8B2EAC6D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1421159005:0":{"text":"第二部、深き烈火を越え、平民でありながら、青年インドラが奇跡を手にする――","source_cn":"第二段，跨越渊底的烈火，青年因度厄所创造的属于平民的奇迹——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7EF115E10914480","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1421159005":{"text":"第二部、深き烈火を越え、平民でありながら、青年インドラが奇跡を手にする――","source_cn":"第二段，跨越渊底的烈火，青年因度厄所创造的属于平民的奇迹——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7EF115E10914480","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1421159006:0":{"text":"キミ、その時もう成人してたっけ？セレと同じぐらいじゃなかった？","source_cn":"那时你成年了吗？和席蕾差不多大吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC61E700087CA74B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1421159007:0":{"text":"ああ、成人してたね。間違いない。ボクが未成年に手を出すはずがないもの。","source_cn":"哦，对！成年了，我想起来了，我不会搭讪未成年的小孩子的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE53357856EB537B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1421159008:1":{"text":"……あなたが殴り倒された場面は、もっと悲惨に書いてもらうべきですね。","source_cn":"……这段揍你的词写得还可以更激烈一些。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBDC6AB5C958C2F76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":""